Act as a senior full-stack software architect, expert React + TypeScript developer, UI/UX designer, e-commerce marketplace engineer, payment integration specialist, cybersecurity engineer, and dropshipping automation architect.

Your task is to DESIGN AND BUILD a complete, modern, responsive, professional, feature-rich global e-commerce marketplace called **DH&Co — Daily Heaven & Company**.

Do not build only a landing page, static mockup, dashboard screenshot, or simple demo shop. Build a cohesive application with connected navigation, functional interactions, realistic sample data, working state management, complete buyer and seller workflows, an owner-controlled admin panel, and a clear architecture for real backend and third-party integrations.

